与 https://github.com/alibaba/fastjson2/issues/7828 同类：aarch64 + JDK8 对 `char[]` 做 unaligned `Unsafe.getLong` / `putLong`。#7828 是 `writeInt3` 数字路径；这里是 boolean 读取（`isALSE`）和字符串写入（`JSONWriterUTF16JDK8UF`）。


