• labelLayout → has geometry but cannot change formatter
• No documented way to switch label content based on node size

Large tile  → 🖼 logo + text + numbers  
Medium tile → 🖼 logo + text  
Small tile  → 🖼 logo  
Tiny tile   → hidden

